{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991110/extras/6e3d51ddece1cf05a63c95d78dcc4c5d.avif?t=1771823364\" width=780 height=174 /></span>You have a date to make! But, it looks like you got there too early... Explore a quiet corner of the bustling city by interacting with locals, playing games at the arcade, fishing, and much more. Leave your date waiting, or fail to impress them with your natural charisma, and you'll be left <i>on &quot;read&quot;</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, walk the walk and talk the talk? You may have just secured yourself a second date! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991110/extras/4ccb13e988a045b202d427cb4fb46b78.poster.avif?t=1771823364\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991110/extras/4ccb13e988a045b202d427cb4fb46b78.webm?t=1771823364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991110/extras/4ccb13e988a045b202d427cb4fb46b78.mp4?t=1771823364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991110/extras/7f0c8bf53af2e6bbdcc2316f355ae4b8.avif?t=1771823364\" width=780 height=174 /></span>There are many <strong>minigames</strong> to find around the city. These include fishing, playing arcade games, hide and seek, and more! The activities you choose to partake in will affect the available topics of conversations with your date. Pay close attention, as your date may have some questions for you regarding these activities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991110/extras/7200371e8f2be36e287555dc2fdb376e.poster.avif?t=1771823364\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991110/extras/7200371e8f2be36e287555dc2fdb376e.webm?t=1771823364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991110/extras/7200371e8f2be36e287555dc2fdb376e.mp4?t=1771823364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are spending the day in the arcade or picking out flowers for your potential lover, <strong>time marches on</strong>. Spend your time wisely to get the most out of your day. If you miss out on something, there's always <strong>Another Day with You</strong>, and another chance for love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Salty Seadog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1991110/edc949a76cc1ed3e1f1ba928afdcb0f2771b3ff5.jpg"},{"name":"Uh, I choose this one","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1991110/4b61adf9c72516cb7f41b98af5ec57d304f2cf09.jpg"},{"name":"Victory!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1991110/d10c9fa0510cf280d9179c807843dd4b8545d0df.jpg"},{"name":"Lone Wolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1991110/3d9c2ba1902115ad87aa7d8483db618b6a0e2dc2.jpg"},{"name":"Cerulia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1991110/fa8a009a1699eb4e7224479cdd7872aea0e50bff.jpg"},{"name":"Here's to Another Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1991110/3ffe74900bb06f957e5009aa90b85b4c2f70c16b.jpg"},{"name":"Well met","path":"https://cdn.a